## Configuration & Setup

### Default Skills Enabled
- Systematic Debugging (enabled)
- Code Review & Analysis (enabled)
- Refactoring & Optimization (enabled)
- Brainstorming & Ideation (enabled)
- Technical Writing (enabled)
- Test Strategy & Planning (enabled)

### Optional Skills (Enable as needed)
- Root Cause Analysis (optional)
- Documentation Review (optional)
- Unit Test Generation (optional)
- Project Planning & Estimation (optional)
- Requirements Analysis (optional)
- Technical Problem Solving (optional)

---

## Usage Guidelines

### Activating a Skill
```
@ai [skill-name] [task description]
```

### Example Usage
```
@ai systematic-debugging Debug the memory leak in production
@ai brainstorming Generate 5 alternative architectures for microservices
@ai technical-writing Create API documentation for REST endpoints
```

---

## Integration Notes

- Skills are designed to work independently or in combination
- Each skill can be extended with domain-specific context
- Custom skills can be added by extending this configuration
- Skills respect project-specific coding standards and guidelines

